{"id":"wb-7-1067","name":"北岸廊桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北岸廊桥","text":"北岸廊桥位于中国安徽省黄山市歙县北岸镇北岸村伏源河上，原名北溪桥，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n北岸廊桥建于清中期，是一座三孔两墩的石拱桥，桥面全长33米，宽4.7米，高6米。桥上建有廊屋十一间，廊屋南、北两端有桥门，门额分别为“乡贤星”和“谦庵旧址”。正中间桥屋开间较大，其西侧设有佛龛。沿墙置坐凳。东西两侧各开8个方窗和风洞窗。。北岸廊桥是徽州地区现存规模较大的古代廊桥。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E5%B2%B8%E5%BB%8A%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":90904850,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90904850","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0625683e2009fef186cba6e2.jpg","title":"風雨廊橋1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8%E5%BB%8A%E6%A9%8B1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%A8%E5%BB%8A%E6%A9%8B1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"洪洋 (中文維基百科的Hongyang813)","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​風雨廊橋外觀","width":320,"height":240}}